            {
              "text": "A tornado struck Estenwick, Dray Corners, and surrounding areas in Ostley County, resulting in 9 deaths, 38 injuries, destruction of key infrastructure including a school and gymnasium, displacement of approximately 240 people, and hazardous conditions that prompted evacuations and emergency response.",
